{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（丁丑、一七）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（丁丑、一七）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f37-db0e-11ef-9b41-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93384f3b-db0e-11ef-8faf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本無「王」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本无「王」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f3a-db0e-11ef-8aaf-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"93384f39-db0e-11ef-ae56-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f3d-db0e-11ef-a953-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"93384f3e-db0e-11ef-b206-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"泰社","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰社","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"93384f3f-db0e-11ef-95a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：尚書·禹貢，包匭菁茅，儒者以爲菁，菜名也；茅，三脊茅也。而莽此言以菁茅爲一物，則是謂善茅爲菁茅也。土有五色，而此云四者，中央之土不以封也。春秋大傳曰：天子之國有泰社，東方青，南方赤，西方白，北方黑，上方黃。故將封於東方者取青土，封於南者取赤土，封於西者取白土，封於北者取黑土，各取其方土，裹以白茅，封以爲社，此始受封於天子者也。此之謂主土；主土者，立社以奉之也。菁，音精。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：尚书·禹贡，包匦菁茅，儒者以为菁，菜名也；茅，三脊茅也。而莽此言以菁茅为一物，则是谓善茅为菁茅也。土有五色，而此云四者，中央之土不以封也。春秋大传曰：天子之国有泰社，东方青，南方赤，西方白，北方黑，上方黄。故将封于东方者取青土，封于南者取赤土，封于西者取白土，封于北者取黑土，各取其方土，裹以白茅，封以为社，此始受封于天子者也。此之谓主土；主土者，立社以奉之也。菁，音精。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"93384f3c-db0e-11ef-9379-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93384f43-db0e-11ef-91ad-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[时年六十二]"},{"people_name":"后土","people_name_jianti_auto":"后土","people_xingming":"后土","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"93384f44-db0e-11ef-a968-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"93384f45-db0e-11ef-acae-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[时年六十二]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"岱宗","place_name_jianti_auto":"岱宗","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"93384f46-db0e-11ef-a975-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰社","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰社","resolved_place_entity_id":7819,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"93384f47-db0e-11ef-9a1b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1夏，六月，莽更授諸侯王茅土於明堂；親設文石之平，陳菁茅四色之土，告於岱宗、泰社、后土、先祖、先妣以班授之。莽好空言，慕古法，多封爵人；性實吝嗇，託以地理未定，故且先賦茅土，用慰喜封者。","content_fanyi":"夏季，六月，王莽在明堂重新向诸侯王颁授白茅包裹的泥土；他亲自用有纹理的石头砌成坛位台阶，陈列菁茅和四色泥土，祭告泰山、泰社、后土、先祖、先妣，然后依次颁授给诸侯。王莽喜欢说空话，仰慕古代制度，大量给人封爵；但本性吝啬，借口封国疆域尚未划定，所以暂时只先授予白茅包裹的泥土，用来安抚那些喜欢封爵的人。","content_jianti_auto":"1夏，六月，莽更授诸侯王茅土于明堂；亲设文石之平，陈菁茅四色之土，告于岱宗、泰社、后土、先祖、先妣以班授之。莽好空言，慕古法，多封爵人；性实吝啬，托以地理未定，故且先赋茅土，用慰喜封者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2887,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f38-db0e-11ef-ad0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"李奇","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f4a-db0e-11ef-9484-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"93384f4b-db0e-11ef-97db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"93384f4c-db0e-11ef-bfec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李","people_name_jianti_auto":"李","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"93384f4d-db0e-11ef-b8bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李奇曰：以五色藥石及銅爲之。蘇林曰：以五色銅鑛治之。師古曰：李說是也，若今作鍮石之爲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李奇曰：以五色药石及铜为之。苏林曰：以五色铜鑛治之。师古曰：李说是也，若今作𨱎石之为。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"93384f49-db0e-11ef-bc9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f50-db0e-11ef-80e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：厭，音一葉翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：厌，音一叶翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"93384f4f-db0e-11ef-acd9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"司命","official_note":"司命是王莽时期设立的官职，负责军事或礼仪事务，此处指负责背负威斗的官员，源自资治通鉴记载。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"令司命負之","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a07eb3c2-25a0-4664-a39b-3c71cf62c721"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93384f51-db0e-11ef-ae90-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[时年六十二]"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"93384f52-db0e-11ef-9e32-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[时年六十二]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2秋，八月，莽親之南郊，鑄作威斗，以五石銅爲之，若北斗，長二尺五寸，欲以厭勝衆兵。旣成，令司命負之，莽出在前，入在御旁。","content_fanyi":"秋季八月，王莽亲自到南郊，监督铸造威斗。威斗是用五色石和铜一起烧炼铸成的，形状像北斗，长二尺五寸，想用它来诅咒镇压各地叛乱的兵马。铸成之后，命令司命背着它；王莽外出时，威斗在前开路，回宫后就放在御座旁边。","content_jianti_auto":"2秋，八月，莽亲之南郊，铸作威斗，以五石铜为之，若北斗，长二尺五寸，欲以厌胜众兵。既成，令司命负之，莽出在前，入在御旁。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2888,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93384f48-db0e-11ef-b433-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否采纳纳言冯常关于六筦的谏言","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_93384F53DB0E11EF9A7BA0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"如何处置报告盗贼实情的使者","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_93384F53DB0E11EF9A7BA0D3651F611F_02"},{"decision_name":"如何对待迎合自己心意的言论","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_93384F53DB0E11EF9A7BA0D3651F611F_03"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鹽，一也。酒，二也。鐵，三也。名山、大澤四也。五均、賒貸，五也。鐵布、銅冶，六也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"盐，一也。酒，二也。铁，三也。名山、大泽四也。五均、赊贷，五也。铁布、铜冶，六也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"93384f54-db0e-11ef-8375-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f58-db0e-11ef-86ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：簿，計簿也，音步戶翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：簿，计簿也，音步户翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"93384f57-db0e-11ef-a633-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93384f5f-db0e-11ef-9697-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"93384f60-db0e-11ef-b7e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「出」下有「錢」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「出」下有「钱」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f5e-db0e-11ef-b5a6-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"93384f5d-db0e-11ef-a4bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f62-db0e-11ef-8565-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：繇，讀曰傜。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：繇，读曰傜。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"93384f61-db0e-11ef-adee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f64-db0e-11ef-ab00-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：旁，依也，音步浪翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：旁，依也，音步浪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"93384f63-db0e-11ef-b37c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93384f67-db0e-11ef-8079-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"93384f68-db0e-11ef-a58e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"93384f69-db0e-11ef-a0e1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本無「能」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本无「能」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f66-db0e-11ef-8d0e-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":203,"tongjian_id":"93384f65-db0e-11ef-9238-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93384f70-db0e-11ef-8274-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"覆，敷救翻。師古曰：浸淫，猶漸染也。余謂此以水爲諭，漸浸而至於淫溢也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"覆，敷救翻。师古曰：浸淫，犹渐染也。余谓此以水为谕，渐浸而至于淫溢也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":240,"tongjian_id":"93384f6f-db0e-11ef-8e0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93384f73-db0e-11ef-9368-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"93384f74-db0e-11ef-bd7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"93384f75-db0e-11ef-9a82-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「儀」下有「等」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「仪」下有「等」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93384f72-db0e-11ef-ae53-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"93384f71-